# Basic boiler Plate Doc | Grade A
# Why this file exists: Keeps the build context small and keeps local secrets out of images.
# Grade A here: nothing in this file is specific to this project. Copy it unchanged.
# Grades: A copy into a new project as is, no edits. B copy it and swap the
# names, paths or patterns named above. C leave behind, it is this project's
# own content rather than scaffolding, and is not tagged.

.git
.gitignore
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
.venv
venv
node_modules
finops-web/dist
# Generated type output and test artefacts. They are build products, they are
# root owned when they reach a non root builder, and they broke the web image
# with EACCES on dist-types. ISS-143.
finops-web/dist-types
finops-web/dist-types-node
finops-web/test-results
finops-web/playwright-report
infra
docs
tasks
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
scratch
tmp
